I am please to announce the approval by the FSG/OpenPrinting Steering Committee of the 

Job Ticket Application Programming interface (JTAPI) Version 1.0

at the July 14, 2005 meeting.  The latest Release Request is located at:

   
ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/fsg/jobticket/Release_Request/JTAPI-Release-Request-V0102-2005-0715.doc
   
ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/fsg/jobticket/Release_Request/JTAPI-Release-Request-V0102-2005-0715.pdf

The Job Ticket Application Programming interface (JTAPI) Version 1.0 Specification is located at:

   ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/fsg/jobticket/JTAPI_Spec/fsg-openprinting-job-ticket-api-v0100-20050315.doc
   ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/fsg/jobticket/JTAPI_Spec/fsg-openprinting-job-ticket-api-v0100-20050315.pdf

